{
    "title": "Set Poker by Pokerist",
    "description": "<b><u>\u25c6 Game features \u25c6</u></b>\r\n<b>\u2022 FREE CHIPS</b>\u2014Play the game every day to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 POKER AGAINST THE CASINO</b>\u2014Get three cards in your hand and use them to play against the dealer! If your hand is stronger, you win!\r\n<b>\u2022 NEW COMBINATIONS</b>\u2014Place Lucky 3 and Lucky 6 bets and win even more chips! Learn awesome new three-card combinations like a three-card straight or royal flush. Get 50-to-1 payouts!\r\n<b>\u2022 STAR TOURNAMENT</b>\u2014Play in our casino and enter a fun tournament! Each time you win in the game, you get stars and progress up the leaderboard. Incredible prizes await the top players!\r\n<b>\u2022 CASINO GAMES</b>\u2014Enjoy a variety of casino games: Texas Hold'em, blackjack, Omaha, Spades, roulette, baccarat, slots, video poker, craps, and Keno\u2014all in one app!\r\n<b>\u2022 VIP LEVELS</b>\u2014Get huge bonuses and exclusive access to the latest in-game features!\r\n<b>\u2022 FAIR PLAY GUARANTEED</b>\u2014All our games use a Random Number Generator (RNG) and are certified by independent experts. We guarantee the best and fairest Set Poker experience!\r\n<b>\u2022 CHAT WITH OTHER PLAYERS</b>\u2014Have even more fun at the casino tables with our convenient in-game chat, instant messenger and animated emoji. Discuss the hands played or share your emotions with your poker opponents and friends!\r\n<b>\u2022 REFERRAL SYSTEM</b>\u2014Invite your friends to play poker with three cards, and everyone will get a reward!\r\n<b>\u2022 BUILD YOUR PROFILE</b>\u2014Share your successes with friends. Show off how many games you've played, your biggest wins, level, card collections, achievements, property and trophies!\r\n<b>\u2022 UNIQUE AVATAR</b>\u2014Create a one-of-a-kind look in the avatar editor.\r\n<b>\u2022 QUESTS</b>\u2014Complete daily quests to get free chips!\r\n<b>\u2022 EASY LEARN TO PLAY</b>\u2014Are you new to poker with three cards but always wanted to try it? Our simple-to-follow tutorial mode will help you take the first steps!\r\n<b>\u2022 NO REGISTRATION</b>\u2014Choose guest mode to play poker with three cards immediately after installing the game!\r\n<b>\u2022 SINGLE ACCOUNT</b>\u2014Play poker with three cards on different devices. Choose the authorization method that works best for you and start playing Set Poker right away for free!\r\n\r\n\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2660\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f <b><u>Want more than Set Poker?</u></b> \u2663\ufe0f\u2660\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\r\nTry our other games for an unforgettable 3D experience:\r\n<b>\u2022 TEXAS HOLD'EM POKER</b>\u2014The most popular casino game among professional gamblers! Test your skills in amazing poker tournaments!\r\n<b>\u2022 BLACKJACK</b>\u2014A simple game of \"21\". An exciting 3D game that any blackjack fan is sure to enjoy.\r\n<b>\u2022 SLOTS</b>\u2014Explore our themed slots with lots of unique features!\r\n<b>\u2022 ROULETTE</b>\u2014Featuring stunning 3D graphics and three table varieties: French, American, and European.\r\n<b>\u2022 OMAHA POKER</b>\u2014A more dynamic version of poker with 4 cards in a hand. Have more fun with amazing combinations!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to the official Facebook page of the game and be the first to find out about our promotions and news! \r\nhttps://facebook.com/Pokerist\r\nFollow us on Twitter and get free chips! \r\nhttps://twitter.com/KamaCasino\r\nSet Poker by Pokerist is intended for those 21 and older for entertainment purposes only and does not offer real-money gambling or an opportunity to win real money or real prizes. Success in playing this game does not imply your success in a similar real-money casino game.\r\n\r\nSet Poker by Pokerist does not require payment to download and play, but it does allow you to purchase virtual items with real money in the game. The app may also contain advertising.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://wisewaveltd.com/terms-of-use \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wisewaveltd.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nPublished by Wise Wave Corporation Limited\r\nUnit A6, 12/F HUNG FUK FTY BLDG, 60 Hung To Road, Kwun Tong, Hong Kong",
